# Roadmap Discipline

Follow the enterprise roadmap, but treat volatile status as authoritative in `docs/current/PROJECT_STATE.md`.

## Current priority

1. **P0 — Senior merchant readiness** (`docs/handoffs/DEVELOPMENT_READINESS_MERCHANT_UX_REVIEW.md`)
2. Full-suite recovery and acceptance testing (evidence required)
3. Phase 9 connected-channel foundation after readiness blockers (approved plan; not complete)
4. Later platform phases only after the above

## Deferred until readiness and external approval gates permit

- Additional carrier expansion
- SaaS subscription/billing expansion
- Payment expansion beyond current foundations

## Claims discipline

Do not make unsupported “complete,” “live,” or “production-ready” claims. Prefer truthful gating or hiding of unfinished surfaces.

## Testing discipline

Use focused tests during implementation. Require a successful full-suite run with evidence before sign-off. Do not treat `docs/archive/**` as current instructions.
